  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **Second number = (First number + Third number) × 2**\n\n**(12, 36, 6)**\n\n→ 36 = (12 + 6) × 2\n\n→ 36 = 18 × 2\n\n**(18, 54, 9)**\n\n→ 54 = (18 + 9) × 2\n\n→ 54 = 27 × 2\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **(28, 84, 16)**\n\n→ 84 = (28 + 16) × 2\n\n→ 84 ≠ 44 × 2\n\n2) **(28, 86, 14)**\n\n→ 86 = (28 + 14) × 2\n\n→ 86 ≠ 42 × 2\n\n3) **(28, 84, 14)**\n\n→ 84 = (28 + 14) × 2\n\n→ 84 = 42 × 2 ⇒ **Follows the logic.**\n\n4) **(26, 84, 14)**\n\n→ 84 = (26 + 14) × 2\n\n→ 84 ≠ 40 × 2\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****(28, 84, 14)\"**.",
